  "body": "The Selectors spec has a [Guidance on Mapping Source Documents & Data to an Element Tree](https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#dom-mapping) appendix, and DOM should define such a mapping (to its [Data Model](https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#data-model)) according to @tabatkins.",
